guide forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key
title The Azure Key
category Class
class Rogue
folder Rogue
levels 50-52
zone Alterac Mountains
keywords The Azure Key, A Simple Request, Sealed Azure Bag, Encoded Fragments, Lord Jorach Ravenholdt, Ravenholdt Manor, Archmage Xylem, Timbermaw Shaman, Forest Ooze, Morphaz, Sunken Temple, Temple of Atal'Hakkar, Azshara, Rogue, class quest
reward text Ravenholdt reputation
why Ravenholdt reputation and experience at 50; Forever removed the Classic item choice.

# The level 52 Rogue class chain: A Simple Request (8233) from your class
# leaders to Lord Jorach Ravenholdt, then Sealed Azure Bag (8234) and Encoded
# Fragments (8235) with Archmage Xylem in Azshara, and The Azure Key (8236)
# from Morphaz in the Sunken Temple back to Lord Ravenholdt.
# Forever change (Forever's Rogue class quest list,
# data/local/quest-audit/): The Azure Key no longer
# offers its reward choices (Duskbat Drape, Ebon Mask, Whisperwalk Boots); the
# chain pays experience, money and Ravenholdt reputation only.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json for the givers, drops and
# spawns; travel.json for the flight points; the quest text of The Azure Key
# (quest 8236) for Morphaz's lair. Morphaz has no spawn in
# the data: he is an elite boss inside the Sunken Temple, a dungeon; the
# entrance point is the one alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater uses for the
# temple (Swamp of Sorrows 69.9,53.6), which matches the point from players' reports
# used by
# class/hunter/the-hunters-charm.
# Based on data, not play: the beta caps at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November, so nothing here has been checked in game.

step A Simple Request (Alliance)
  only Alliance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 50 Osborne the Night Man in Stormwind's Old Town has it; so do Syurna in Darnassus and Hulfdan Blackbeard and Fenthwick in Ironforge.
  level 50
  accept 8233 npc 918                         -- Osborne the Night Man

step A Simple Request (Horde)
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 50 Ormok in the Cleft of Shadow has it; so does Miles Dexter in the Undercity's Rogues' Quarter.
  level 50
  accept 8233 npc 3328                        -- Ormok

step Lord Jorach Ravenholdt
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Ravenholdt Manor hides in the hills east of Tarren Mill, up a path into the Alterac Mountains. Horde fly to Tarren Mill, Alliance to Southshore.
  turnin 8233                                 -- Lord Jorach Ravenholdt
  accept 8234

step Sealed Azure Bag
  zone Azshara
  tip Alliance fly to Talrendis Point, Horde to Valormok. The Timbermaw Shamans in Azshara's northern hills drop the bag, about one in thirty.
  getfp "Talrendis Point" only Alliance
  getfp "Valormok" only Horde
  collect 19775 quest 8234.1                  -- Sealed Azure Bag: Timbermaw Shaman

step Archmage Xylem
  turnin 8234                                 -- Archmage Xylem
  accept 8235

step Encoded Fragments
  tip The Forest Oozes of southern Azshara drop the fragments.
  collect 20023 quest 8235.1                  -- Encoded Fragment: Forest Ooze

step Back to Xylem
  turnin 8235                                 -- Archmage Xylem
  accept 8236

step Morphaz in the Sunken Temple
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Morphaz, a green drake, is an elite boss deep in the Sunken Temple, a level 50 dungeon: bring a group of five. The temple stands in the Pool of Tears; swim down to the entrance. Horde: fly to Stonard; Alliance: fly to Nethergarde Keep and ride on.
  collect 20022 quest 8236.1 @69.9,53.6       -- Azure Key: Morphaz, inside the temple

step Lord Ravenholdt
  zone Alterac Mountains
  turnin 8236                                 -- Lord Jorach Ravenholdt: no item choices in Forever
